  "question": "Water falls from a height of $60$ m at the rate of $15$ kg/s to operate a turbine. The losses due to frictional force are $10\\%$ of the input energy. How much power is generated by the turbine ? ($g = 10\\ \\text{m/s}^2$)",
  "diagram": "",
  "diagram_alt": "",
  "options": [
