  ],
  "answer": "C",
  "numerical_answer": "",
  "tolerance": "",
  "solution": "Input power:\n$$P_{in} = \\frac{dm}{dt}gh = 15 \\times 10 \\times 60 = 9000\\ \\text{W}$$\n\nAfter $10\\%$ losses:\n$$P = 0.9 \\times 9000 = 8100\\ \\text{W} = 8.1\\ \\text{kW}$$",
